    {"id":"eulaliatears","path":"Priest","name":"Phial of Saint Eulalia's Tears","kind":"relic","category":"Relic","slots":1,"found":true,"table":"pathrelics","loot":[51,55],"roll":"","effort":8,"horror":2,"uses":3,"temptsHorror":true,"band":"near","use":"Action","effect":"healing","flavour":"Clear, salt and still warm. The saint has been dead four hundred years.","does":"Yourself or any target in Close or Near heals d8. No check. Once per person per rest. Each use adds 2 Horror (1 for a Priest). 3 uses; then the phial is dry. The table applies healing and tracks this limit.","horrorReason":"Using this item's supernatural power tempts the Horror, whether it succeeds or fails."},
    {"id":"defrockedstole","path":"Priest","tags":["shelter"],"name":"The Defrocked Stole","kind":"relic","category":"Relic","slots":1,"found":true,"table":"pathrelics","loot":[56,60],"roll":"WIS","horror":2,"temptsHorror":true,"band":"near","use":"Action","effect":"esoteric","flavour":"Stripped from a priest at the altar rail. The gold thread still moves at the hem.","does":"Lay it across a threshold or a grave and make a WIS check. On success, until dawn the dead do not rise within Near of it, and those who shelter there feel no bitter cold. Each attempt adds 2 Horror (1 for a Priest). The GM resolves the ward.","horrorReason":"Using this item's supernatural power tempts the Horror, whether it succeeds or fails."},
    {"id":"waxpoppet","path":"Witch","name":"The Wax Poppet","kind":"relic","category":"Relic","slots":1,"found":true,"table":"pathrelics","loot":[61,65],"roll":"INT","cat":"magic","effort":10,"horror":3,"uses":2,"temptsHorror":true,"band":"far","use":"Action","effect":"damage","flavour":"Soft church wax, with a few hairs pressed into the head.","does":"Name one foe you can see in Near or Far, press a thorn into the poppet and make an INT check. On success the wound opens in its flesh: roll Magic Effort d10 damage. Each attempt adds 3 Horror (2 for a Witch). 2 uses, hit or miss; then the wax splits.","horrorReason":"Using this item's supernatural power tempts the Horror, whether it succeeds or fails."},
    {"id":"windcord","path":"Witch","tags":["snuff"],"name":"The Knotted Wind-Cord","kind":"relic","category":"Relic","slots":1,"found":true,"table":"pathrelics","loot":[66,70],"roll":"","horror":2,"uses":3,"temptsHorror":true,"band":"near","use":"Action","effect":"esoteric","flavour":"Sold on the quays to sailors who did not ask who tied it.","does":"Untie one knot and a hard wind rises around you: candles, torches and small fires within Near go out, and a foe made of fire, or carrying it, loses its next attack. No check. Each knot adds 2 Horror (1 for a Witch). 3 uses; then it is only string. The GM resolves what the wind reaches.","horrorReason":"Using this item's supernatural power tempts the Horror, whether it succeeds or fails."},
    {"id":"ashcrown","path":"Penitent","tags":["guard"],"name":"Crown of Ash and Bramble","kind":"relic","category":"Relic","slots":1,"found":true,"table":"pathrelics","loot":[71,75],"roll":"CON","horror":2,"uses":3,"temptsHorror":true,"band":"self","use":"Action","effect":"esoteric","flavour":"Woven on Ash Wednesday and never taken off by its first owner, who died in it.","does":"Press it onto your brow and make a CON check. On success blows turn on you as on a wall: +2 Defence until your next turn. Each attempt adds 2 Horror (1 for a Penitent). 3 uses; then the brambles crumble. The GM applies and removes the bonus.","horrorReason":"Using this item's supernatural power tempts the Horror, whether it succeeds or fails."},
    {"id":"vigiltaper","path":"Penitent","tags":["light"],"name":"The Penitent's Vigil Taper","kind":"relic","category":"Relic","slots":1,"found":true,"table":"pathrelics","loot":[76,80],"roll":"","horror":2,"uses":4,"temptsHorror":true,"band":"near","use":"Action","effect":"esoteric","flavour":"A thin brown taper. It lights from a drop of its bearer’s blood and nothing else.","does":"Prick your thumb and light it: no flint is needed. Until the scene ends it gives light to Near, and no wind or water puts it out. No check. Each lighting adds 2 Horror (1 for a Penitent). 4 uses; then it has burned down to the wick.","horrorReason":"Using this item's supernatural power tempts the Horror, whether it succeeds or fails."},
    {"id":"leechjar","path":"Barber-surgeon","name":"Jar of Black Leeches","kind":"relic","category":"Relic","slots":1,"found":true,"table":"pathrelics","loot":[81,85],"roll":"WIS","effort":8,"horror":2,"uses":3,"temptsHorror":true,"band":"close","use":"Action","effect":"healing","flavour":"They are fat, and quiet, and they never seem to grow hungry.","does":"Set them on yourself or a hurt target in Close and make a WIS check. On success they draw out the bad blood: heal d8. Once per person per rest. Each attempt adds 2 Horror (1 for a Barber-surgeon). 3 uses, success or failure; then the jar holds only dead leeches. The table applies healing and tracks this limit.","horrorReason":"Using this item's supernatural power tempts the Horror, whether it succeeds or fails."},
    {"id":"lodestonelancet","path":"Barber-surgeon","tags":["learn"],"name":"The Surgeon's Lodestone Lancet","kind":"relic","category":"Relic","slots":1,"found":true,"table":"pathrelics","loot":[86,90],"roll":"INT","horror":2,"temptsHorror":true,"band":"close","use":"Action","effect":"esoteric","flavour":"A fine blade set in a lodestone handle. It trembles over what is wrong.","does":"Pass it over one body in Close, living or dead, and make an INT check. On success you learn one true thing: what killed it, what ails it, or where it is weak. In a fight your next attack against it is Easy. Each attempt adds 2 Horror (1 for a Barber-surgeon). The GM supplies the answer.","horrorReason":"Using this item's supernatural power tempts the Horror, whether it succeeds or fails."},
    {"id":"silverpricker","path":"Witch-finder","name":"The Witch-Finder's Pricker","kind":"relic","category":"Relic","slots":1,"found":true,"table":"pathrelics","loot":[91,95],"roll":"WIS","cat":"magic","effort":10,"horror":2,"temptsHorror":true,"band":"close","use":"Action","effect":"damage","flavour":"A long silver bodkin, blackened at the point. It was used on two hundred women.","does":"Drive it into one Close foe and make a WIS check. On success it finds the place that does not bleed: roll Magic Effort d10 damage. Each attempt adds 2 Horror (1 for a Witch-finder), hit or miss.","horrorReason":"Using this item's supernatural power tempts the Horror, whether it succeeds or fails."},
    {"id":"scoldsbridle","path":"Witch-finder","tags":["silence"],"name":"The Scold's Bridle","kind":"relic","category":"Relic","slots":1,"found":true,"table":"pathrelics","loot":[96,100],"roll":"STR","horror":2,"uses":2,"temptsHorror":true,"band":"close","use":"Action","effect":"esoteric","flavour":"An iron cage for the head, with a spiked plate for the tongue.","does":"Snap it over the jaw of one creature in Close and make a STR check. On success its voice is stopped until the scene ends: it cannot cry out, call or cast. Each attempt adds 2 Horror (1 for a Witch-finder). 2 uses; then the hinge breaks. The GM resolves the effect.","horrorReason":"Using this item's supernatural power tempts the Horror, whether it succeeds or fails."}
